# API reference

This page is generated from vfps's `.proto` files, which define the API. Every RPC is served over
gRPC and, where a REST route is listed, as JSON over HTTP. In JSON, field names are written in
camelCase (`original_value` becomes `originalValue`) and enum values by name. See the
[gRPC API](grpc.md) guide for how to call them, and the
[latest release](https://github.com/miracum/vfps/releases/latest) for the `.proto` files as a
versioned download.
